# This static portfolio needs NO secrets to build or run.
#
# If you later add an optional contact-form service (see README), put ONLY
# public, publishable keys here. Never commit private API keys or tokens.
#
# Vite exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser bundle, so treat
# anything you add here as PUBLIC.
#
# Example (optional, only if you wire up a form service like Formspree):
# VITE_FORMSPREE_FORM_ID=your_public_form_id
